    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21741" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεῖσ-ον</span></b>  (in codd. freq. written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεῖσσον</span></b> ), τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>projecting part of
				the roof, cornice,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				22.463.51
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				18
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				108
			</span></i> (pl.): in pl., of the stones composing it, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.372.152
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. καταιέτια</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.1054.39
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>coping</i> of a wall, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1570
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1620
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1158
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1180
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<i>hem</i> or <i>border of a garment</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				762
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεῖσα ὀφρύων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					2.49
				</span></i>
			.</div>
